    {
      "text": "he shall save his people from their sins, Matt. 1:21. hath raised up an horn of salvation for us, Luke 1:69. To give knowledge of salvation unto his people, Luke 1:77. mine eyes have seen thy salvation, Luke 2:30. salvation is of the Jews, John 4:22. servants … which shew unto us the way of salvation, Acts 16:17. salvation of God is sent unto the Gentiles, Acts 28:28. gospel … is the power of God unto salvation, Rom. 1:16 (D&C 68:4). confession is made unto salvation, Rom. 10:10. now is the day of salvation, 2 Cor. 6:2. godly sorrow worketh repentance to salvation, 2 Cor. 7:10. word of truth, the gospel of your salvation, Eph. 1:13. helmet of salvation, Eph. 6:17. work out your own salvation with fear, Philip. 2:12. for an helmet, the hope of salvation, 1 Thes. 5:8. obtain salvation by our Lord Jesus Christ, 1 Thes. 5:9. chosen you to salvation through sanctification, 2 Thes. 2:13. able to make thee wise unto salvation, 2 Tim. 3:15. grace of God that bringeth salvation, Titus 2:11. author of eternal salvation, Heb. 5:9. by the power of God through faith unto salvation, 1 Pet. 1:5. Of which salvation the prophets have inquired, 1 Pet. 1:10.",
